  "id": "barbecue-pulled-pork-pizza",
  "name": "Barbecue Pulled Pork Pizza",
  "subtitle": "A cheesy pizza topped with tangy pork, pickles, and red onion",
  "description": "Bake refrigerated pizza dough with barbequed pulled pork, crisp pickle slices, red onion, and melted mozzarella for a savory, tangy meal.",
